WEBVTT

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.240
I’m hungry, aren’t you?

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.350
I’m home.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.390
Welcome home, Onee-chan.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.810
Thank you for your hard work.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.180
Dinner is almost ready, so please wait a bit.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:46.920
Sure!

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.970
What’s for dinner tonight?

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:58.170
Tonight’s dinner is mushroom and potato stew over rice.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.150
Thanks for the food!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.460
It’s delicious!

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.320
<i>I’m content as long as Asu is happy and healthy.</i>

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.160
<i>Her smile always makes me feel at ease.</i>

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:47.910
<i>But, sometimes I fail to understand Asu’s true feelings.{p. sure comma is wrong but the way the line is delivered it just feels like it should be in there}</i>

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.090
<i>I regret it when I don’t notice that she’s sad.</i>

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.010
Reminder about this year’s 4th

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.010
Reminder about this year’s 4th Parents' day

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.010
Parents' Day

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.010
<i>When that happens, I always think,</i>

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:02.850
<i>“I have to hurry up and become a grown-up like mom!”</i>

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:16.060
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.660
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.520
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:28.450
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.880
This is our home.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:33.560
But, when spring comes…

